WEBVTT

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:30.476
Thursday night is illicit drug use.

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:33.929
And Friday night we're trying to decide
between risky sex or happiness."

00:08:33.953 --> 00:08:34.976
(Laughter)

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:37.143
I said, "That's most people's
Friday nights."

00:08:37.167 --> 00:08:39.976
(Laughter)

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:42.976
(Applause)

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:45.858
Which I'm glad you liked,
but they did not like that at all.

00:08:45.882 --> 00:08:46.976
Silence on the phone.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:50.276
And into the silence, I said,
"I'd be happy to speak at your school,

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:52.976
but that's not a wellness week,
that's a sickness week.

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:55.676
You've outlined all the negative
things that can happen,

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:57.376
but not talked about the positive."

00:08:57.400 --> 00:08:59.176
The absence of disease is not health.

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:00.576
Here's how we get to health: